WEBVTT

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.450
Look, the ocean is so pretty today.

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.790
I've never felt that the ocean is beautiful.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:21.620
From the moment we were born,
the ocean was a place for war.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.370
There's nothing beautiful about that.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.160
Besides, Sister, the ocean is where you...

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.870
That's not true.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.040
You're only forgetting.

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:36.950
We are ships, taking on the form of humans.

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:42.290
The beauty of the seas
is engraved deep inside our souls.

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:51.080
One day, you'll remember what wishes
the people placed in your name.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:48.540
"Aircraft Carrier <i>Yorktown</i> "

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:54.330
Blessings to the azure lanes.

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:58.120
Enterprise, my dear little sister.

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.330
Yorktown... My sister...

00:01:24.330 --> 00:01:27.200
Oh? You sound cute
when you talk in your sleep.

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:35.500
Good morning. Did you sleep well?

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:36.910
You're...

00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:41.250
"Light Cruiser <i>Belfast</i> "

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:41.250
I am Belfast, the maid.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.250
Zuikaku!

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.250
Zuikaku?

00:03:26.250 --> 00:03:28.500
A maid?! What kind of joke is this?!

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:32.500
She's dead serious.

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:37.660
Royal Navy, second ship in the
Edinburgh class of light cruisers--Belfast.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:41.620
She might look like a joke,
but she's still a legendary warrior.

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.660
Don't underestimate her.

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:48.040
A pleasure to meet you again,
Prinz Eugen of Iron Blood.

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:51.330
I must say, it is an unexpected
pleasure to see you here.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.410
Indeed. Perhaps it's not a bad idea
to settle some old grudges out here,

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:59.040
far away from Iron Blood and Royal Navy.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:02.750
I have no objections to your proposal, but...

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:08.700
That's...

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:13.200
I must remind you that we would be
responding with all of our might.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.000
"Battleship <i>Warspite</i>"

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:17.500
"Battleship <i>Hood</i> "

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.500
"Light Cruiser <i>Edinburgh</i>"

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:22.500
"Light Cruiser <i>Sheffield</i> "

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.500
"Battleship <i>Queen Elizabeth</i>"

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.290
The main Royal Navy fleet...

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.660
So. Have you made your decision?

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:36.950
I guess it's time to quit while we're ahead.

00:04:36.950 --> 00:04:38.000
Listen now!

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.080
The next time I see you, you'd better
apologize for not taking this seriously!

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.500
Hrm...

00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.120
Ayanami.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.160
Bye-bye. See you.

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.160
See you again, Azur Lane.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:18.120
This isn't over, Grey Ghost!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.450
Is something wrong?

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:34.450
I see... You saved me.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:37.330
I'm sorry to have troubled you.

00:05:37.330 --> 00:05:39.540
I am glad no serious harm was done.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.580
Ma'am?

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:49.500
Perhaps you should rest?

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.910
These slight injuries are
commonplace in wartime.

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:55.000
You were in grave danger.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:57.750
Yes. I thank you for your assistance.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:05.250
Breakfast is ready.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:06.700
I have what I need.

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:18.370
♪ Fish and chips! Fish and... ♪

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:21.120
I'll make it much more delicious for you!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:24.410
You put ketchup on my fish and chips?!

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.330
You're not gonna eat?

00:06:24.410 --> 00:06:26.290
Try it, it's yummy!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:28.160
Oh, sorry... I was thinking.

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:29.660
Vinegar is the only way to eat fish and chips!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.750
Really?

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:33.580
My fish and chips!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.410
Actually, too sleepy. Time to quit.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.410
Bye-bye. See you.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:49.660
Hey, Laffey, why did you...

00:06:49.660 --> 00:06:55.750
Fish and chips...

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.910
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.750
Hey! Stop making a scene!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.750
She saved not just the base,
but the Hornet fleet, too.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.580
There's no doubt that
she is extremely powerful.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:19.660
But our bad expectations were met, too.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:23.450
If Belfast didn't intervene,
who knows what would have happened...

00:07:23.450 --> 00:07:26.040
Are you concerned about her?

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:31.330
She saved Unicorn.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:35.500
I do not wish to see her get
ground down over the course of the war.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.910
In that case, perhaps we should
have a word with Her Majesty.

00:07:49.950 --> 00:07:52.160
I understand what you have come to tell me.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:00.410
But isn't that an issue to be
dealt with by the Eagle Union?

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.620
I don't feel it is appropriate
for us to chime in.

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.950
That's...

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:10.910
But Enterprise saved me.

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:17.660
Her strength will surely be
needed in the upcoming battles.

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.790
We cannot let her perish here.

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:24.410
You sound quite determined. May I ask why?

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:27.040
The holy light guides me.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:32.160
That again?

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:37.790
We can't underestimate
her intuition. Don't you agree?

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:43.620
Even if viewed purely as a fighting force,
Enterprise is a key factor for this base.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.950
We cannot ignore the issues that she has.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.410
Warspite, what do you think?

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:53.870
I trust in your judgement, Your Majesty.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.290
In that case, I will be the judge!

00:08:58.290 --> 00:09:01.790
Let's see what kind of ship
Enterprise really is!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.660
Bel!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.000
As you wish, Your Majesty.

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.830
Vestal!

00:09:13.290 --> 00:09:15.950
Finally, a repair ship arrived!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.250
I'm so relieved...

00:09:20.250 --> 00:09:22.330
I'm so sorry to be late.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:25.870
How is our sister, Yorktown?

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:27.870
She's...

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.620
As usual, I guess!

00:09:32.620 --> 00:09:33.790
I see...

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.250
There!

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.410
What are you doing?!

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:44.620
She's my big sister! Don't worry.

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:51.950
So how is Enterprise doing?

00:09:56.830 --> 00:10:00.620
You've been quite reckless, Enterprise.

00:10:00.620 --> 00:10:02.660
I had no other choice.

00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:06.870
Do I have to remind you again
to take better care of yourself?

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.290
The reason of our existence is to fight.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.910
Enterprise!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:16.830
Oh, you are such a troublesome girl!

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:33.250
Unicorn would like to have a word
with you. I will escort you to her.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.790
Um...

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.120
You got me...

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:47.160
Yes! I won!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:49.410
You're so cute, Saratoga!

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.950
How did this happen...?

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.290
Javelin, you look worried.

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:59.660
Laffey...

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:02.370
Best solution is to play.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.410
You're kind of the source of my concern...

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.000
What is Hammann doing here...?

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:16.580
Come on! Eat well, sleep well, play well!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:18.450
That's the key to having a good life!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.790
Come on, you can do better, Saratoga!

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:24.700
San Diego?!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.330
Behind you! Behind you!

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.330
Behin--?

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:31.160
A shark?!

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.750
No!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.040
Help m--

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.410
Stop!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:48.200
Oh no, she's in trouble!
Just wait--I'm on the case! Transform!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:52.700
Witch-girl idol Saratoga- <i>chan</i> ,
officially making my debut!

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.450
Invincible magic!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:58.750
Wait, what...?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:13.330
We're more than just
for fighting, you know?

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.120
What are they doing...?

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.700
Why would you do this so close to the water?!

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.120
I understand that relaxation
is quite important as well.

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:29.950
We were just attacked.

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.450
That's precisely why.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.410
She is calling for you.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.200
Um...

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.370
Did you have business with me?

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:28.250
Well... I just wanted to thank you properly.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:34.620
Enterprise, thank you for saving me!

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:38.450
Oh, you mean during that attack.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:42.950
There is no need to thank me.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:45.330
I just fulfilled my duties,
as is expected of me.

00:13:45.330 --> 00:13:46.450
But...

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:56.870
So pretty...

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:02.200
Look, Enterprise, the ocean is very pretty!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.910
Everyone says the same thing.

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:13.870
I've never felt that the ocean is beautiful.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:18.080
It reminds me of the roar of artillery,
the smell of gunpowder.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:21.830
The heat of a nearby flame,
the cold of the water.

00:14:22.790 --> 00:14:24.620
Those kinds of things.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:30.200
The seas are battlefields.
There is no beauty in that...

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:37.370
Are you afraid of the ocean?

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.330
Afraid? Me?

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:45.580
Unicorn!

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.120
Don't worry about me. Go join them.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.290
Scrub, scrub, scrub!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.830
That hurts!

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.410
How long do you intend to stay this way?

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:09.250
Don't you need to be with Unicorn?

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.750
It would be more desirable
for her to stay with her companions.

00:16:13.750 --> 00:16:17.910
I see. So, why are you following me around?

00:16:20.540 --> 00:16:24.950
My queen has ordered me
to discretely look into this,

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:29.410
but unfortunately, I lack
the necessary skills for such subtlety.

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:30.660
What are you getting at?

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:35.000
Allow me to be blunt.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:38.620
How long do you intend to
continue fighting like you did?

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:44.910
It appears to me as though
you are weary of fighting.

00:16:44.910 --> 00:16:49.160
Meanwhile, however, you seem to be
unconcerned with your own safety.

00:16:51.500 --> 00:16:54.120
Your way of living is deeply flawed.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:58.330
If you maintain this course, you will
surely lose sight of your reason to fight.

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:08.000
It's starting to look rough...

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:12.120
Wales!

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.120
What is it?

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:24.040
I can't believe I have to get wet again...

00:17:24.040 --> 00:17:25.410
Sorry about that.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.410
But we can't ignore a distress call.

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:32.370
We should be getting close...

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:34.500
Did they lose their way in this storm?

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:35.830
Maybe...

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.950
Wait, Enterprise, what are you doing here?!

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:41.120
Your rig isn't repaired yet!

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.620
Do you always begin a mission in that state?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.000
Wait! I see something up ahead!

00:17:58.000 --> 00:18:00.870
Sirens, here?!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.500
No, look closely.

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.080
They've already gone through battle...

00:18:06.080 --> 00:18:10.870
Are the ships that sent out
the distress signal fighting the Sirens?

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:15.120
That means we have to hurry! But...

00:18:15.120 --> 00:18:19.620
In this storm, we can't even scout for
enemies properly. We have to be careful...

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.370
Cover my flank.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.410
Huh?

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.910
Why...? How...?

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.700
Why is she always like this?!

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:51.910
That must be it...

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:17.000
                       "Light Cruiser <i>Ping Hai</i> "

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:17.000
"Light Cruiser <i>Ning Hai</i> "

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:17.000
This outfit...

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:19.620
She must be from the Dragon Empery.

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:25.540
Don't worry, I belong to the Azur Lane.
We tracked your distress signal.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:36.750
Did you defeat the Sirens around here?

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:41.620
Tell me what happened here.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.660
We were being chased by the Sirens...

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:55.250
We beat them all,
but my sister protected me...

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.750
Ning Hai?!

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:02.660
Ping Hai... Are you all right...?

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.700
Good...

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.540
Sister!

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:09.410
Don't worry, we're here to save you.

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:11.080
My companions will arrive shortly.

00:20:19.950 --> 00:20:21.580
It's still moving?!

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:24.250
Run, Ping Hai...

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:27.040
No! This time, I'm protecting my big sister!

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:38.790
Over here!

00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:25.660
I feel that I have a slightly better
understanding of who you are.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:43.700
You are... soft-hearted, Enterprise.

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:48.250
Belfast.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:01.000
Let's go.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.290
Yeah.

00:22:06.870 --> 00:22:11.370
I apologize for this personal remark,
but I have become interested in you.

00:22:11.370 --> 00:22:12.580
What?

00:22:12.580 --> 00:22:14.950
Please allow me to teach you...

00:22:16.870 --> 00:22:22.080
...the proper decorum expected
from a gentlewoman.

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:27.830
Huh?

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:34.290
<i>The ripples seeing each other</i>

00:22:34.290 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>Are messages exchanged with you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:46.080
<i>Connecting us across this blue ocean</i>

00:22:46.080 --> 00:22:51.700
<i>Guideposts of light</i>

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:57.370
<i>Have you met someone nice?</i>

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>Are your days filled with smiles?</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:08.540
<i>Filling your melancholy eyes with light</i>

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>When the starshine wanes in them</i>

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:19.500
<i>I'm close to you</i>

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:25.620
<i>Always by your side</i>

00:23:25.620 --> 00:23:30.870
<i>you can't see the next day</i>

00:23:30.870 --> 00:23:37.160
<i>I am calling out to your heart</i>

00:23:37.160 --> 00:23:42.080
<i>Please stay with me</i>

00:23:42.080 --> 00:23:48.120
<i>Please don't give up</i>

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:57.200
<i>Until the morning comes</i>
<i>when we can hold hands</i>
